notes.content:
The demo version of the game has been updated according to our plans and the feedback received.
Changelog:

 Improved artificial intelligence of bots;
 Improved session creation system;
 Improved replication of moving objects;
 Improved player animations;
 Improved the operation of TAA smoothing;
 Improved the overall visual on maps;
 Improved race finish for better information perception;
 A convenient and understandable start of the race has been created;
 New presets of large birds have been added for more variety;
 Other minor bugs have been fixed.
